  "name": "Fur Seal Rookery Pup-area and Bull-area Relationships",
  "description": "This report describes work performed under contract from the National Marine Mammal Lab. To examine the relationship between rookery area and estimated pup (and harem bull) numbers of northern fur seal during the summer on the Pribilof Islands in the Eastern Bering Sea.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: A report on fur seal rookery pup-area and bull-area relationships",
